sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Browser as User Browser
	participant Gateway as API Gateway
	participant AuthOwner as Session Owner (Storefront or Backoffice)
	participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
	participant API as Capability API

	Browser ->> Gateway: Initiate sign-in
	Gateway ->> AuthOwner: Route to surface auth handler
	AuthOwner ->> Entra: OAuth2 / OIDC authorization request
	Entra -->> AuthOwner: Authorization code & identity claims
	AuthOwner -->> Browser: Issue origin-scoped session cookie
	Browser ->> Gateway: Request protected route or API action
	Gateway ->> AuthOwner: Validate session & supply Bearer token
	Gateway ->> API: Forward request with Bearer token
	API -->> Browser: Authorize roles/scopes & return response
